{"_id":"6a2ff03d2204ffbc59e5a400","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"qOZ-T7zaPjvIT222rSV4o","description":"# Array Operations\n\nNumPy supports a wide range of array operations: element-wise arithmetic, aggregation functions (`sum`, `mean`, `std`, `min`, `max`), reshaping, stacking, and splitting. These operations are vectorized, meaning they apply to the entire array at once without explicit loops, making them highly efficient.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"NumPy Arithmetic Array Operations","url":"https://www.programiz.com/python-programming/numpy/basic-array-operations","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb0d"},{"type":"article","title":"Doing Math with Arrays","url":"https://towardsdatascience.com/introducing-numpy-part-4-doing-math-with-arrays-5e77ac595641/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb0e"},{"type":"video","title":"Ultimate Guide to NumPy Arrays","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lLRBYKwP8GQ","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb0f"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:29:49.127Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/qOZ-T7zaPjvIT222rSV4o.md"}